OL,3,GNEWSAMan found guilty of killing his
OL,4,Adad in pub garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who pushed over and killed his
OL,7,Fnewly-discovered father in a pub garden
OL,8,Fon Christmas Eve has been found guilty
OL,9,Fof manslaughter.
OL,11,FMartin Greensmith, 37, only learnt
OL,12,FSteven Shevels, 61, was his biological
OL,13,Ffather shortly before their encounter
OL,14,Fbehind The Queen's Head in Willington,
OL,15,FCounty Durham, on 24 December, Teesside
OL,16,FCrown Court heard.
OL,18,FGreensmith said he only "gently" pushed
OL,19,FShevels after the victim "intimidated"
OL,20,Fhim, but prosecutors maintained he had
OL,21,Fcaused his death during a fit of anger.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
